msgid "Generic Operating System Services"
msgstr "Layanan Sistem Operasi Generik"

msgid ""
"The modules described in this chapter provide interfaces to operating system "
"features that are available on (almost) all operating systems, such as files "
"and a clock.  The interfaces are generally modeled after the Unix or C "
"interfaces, but they are available on most other systems as well.  Here's an "
"overview:"
msgstr ""
"Modul yang dijelaskan dalam bab ini menyediakan antarmuka untuk fitur sistem "
"operasi yang tersedia pada (hampir) semua sistem operasi, seperti file dan "
"jam. Antarmuka umumnya dimodelkan setelah antarmuka Unix atau C, tetapi "
"mereka tersedia di sebagian besar sistem lain juga. Berikut ini ikhtisar:"
